# Matches the root dagr-mcp package's MANIFEST.in convention: the sdist ships
# the installable package, its license, its readme, and its fork-provenance
# manifest. Development-only test code is pruned so no partial/broken test
# tree enters the distribution (setuptools' default sdist file-finder only
# picks up test_*.py-shaped files, silently dropping this package's non-test-
# prefixed test helper modules and fixture data -- pruning tests/ entirely
# avoids shipping that half-included, unrunnable state).
include LICENSE
include README.md
include EXTRACTION_MANIFEST.json
prune tests
